{"title":"22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Twenty-two is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> after <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Twenty-one&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Twenty-one (page does not exist)\">twenty-one</a> and before <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Twenty-three\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Twenty-three\">twenty-three</a>. Its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Base_10\" title=\"Base 10\">base 10</a> representation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Properties\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is a factor in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_factorization\" title=\"Prime factorization\">prime factorization</a> of the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> along with the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, specifically <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2aaf0417fb3e393a40130268c021498ac7318a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22 \\cdot 92=2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" />.\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\